# Text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with LF on
# every platform, so scripts, templates and tests behave the same on a Windows
# workstation and a Linux server (2.39.25). Binary assets are never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
